  m_text: "Map: \xA9 Stadia Maps, \xA9 OpenMapTiles, \xA9 OpenStreetMap contributors.\n\nEvery
    trail, stop, photo and recording is made by the person who created that trail,
    and belongs to them. Report anything that should not be there from the stop itself.\n\nCamera:
    this application runs on Google Play Services for AR (ARCore), which is provided
    by Google and governed by the Google Privacy Policy.\n\nType: Inter, by Rasmus
    Andersson, under the SIL Open Font License."
